1.1/">Prisha Patnaik</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-132838279,imgsize-14314732.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Quote of the day by Serena Williams: "I really think a champion is defined not by their wins, but by…"]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/132836666.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Serena Williams believes champions are defined by their recovery after falling. True character emerges during moments of defeat, not just victory. Setbacks are an unavoidable part of any genuine journey toward growth. Resilience allows individuals to adapt and try again after disappointment. This powerful message extends beyond sports to all life's challenges.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/quote-of-the-day-by-serena-williams-i-really-think-a-champion-is-defined-not-by-their-wins-but-by-a-powerful-lesson-on-resilience-and-rising-after-failure/articleshow/132836666.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/quote-of-the-day-by-serena-williams-i-really-think-a-champion-is-defined-not-by-their-wins-but-by-a-powerful-lesson-on-resilience-and-rising-after-failure/articleshow/132836666.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-03T22:07:29+05:30</pubDate><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-132836666,imgsize-112875.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Man climbs Brooklyn Bridge, strips naked, plants flags, jumps into East River; survives, identified]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/132836325.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[A 44-year-old man miraculously survived after jumping from the top of New York City's Brooklyn Bridge on Sunday, authorities said. According to the latest update, the man has been identified as Galymzhan Abaildayev, a Brooklyn resident, who now faces multiple charges following the dramatic incident. Videos of the incident show shocked onlookers screaming as the man jumped from the bridge.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/44-year-old-man-climbs-brooklyn-bridge-strips-naked-plants-flags-and-jumps-into-east-river-survives-identified-and-charged-by-nypd-report/articleshow/132836325.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/44-year-old-man-climbs-brooklyn-bridge-strips-naked-plants-flags-and-jumps-into-east-river-survives-identified-and-charged-by-nypd-report/articleshow/132836325.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-03T21:39:44+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-132836325,imgsize-53278.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Robbery attempt at Indian men waiting in parking lot after 11 pm, multi-city chase by police in Texas]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/132836551.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/robbery-attempt-at-indian-men-waiting-in-parking-lot-after-11-pm-multi-city-chase-by-police-in-texas/articleshow/132836551.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/robbery-attempt-at-indian-men-waiting-in-parking-lot-after-11-pm-multi-city-chase-by-police-in-texas/articleshow/132836551.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-03T21:45:47+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-132836570,imgsize-57320.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[World’s third-smallest country Nauru renamed Naoero, code shifts to NRO]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" 